  "code": "class Solution:\n    def dailyTemperatures(self, temperatures):\n        # 先说明变量含义，再完成你的实现\n                # 初始化和数组等长的0数组\n        ans = [0]*len(temperatures)\n        # 初始化栈\n        stack =[]\n\n        for i,temperature in enumerate(temperatures):\n            # 当栈非空且当前数比栈顶元素大\n            while stack and temperature>temperatures[stack[-1]]:\n                # 移除栈顶的元素并记录\n                prev=stack.pop()\n                # 保存答案\n                ans[prev]=i-prev\n            # 栈存入元素的下标\n            stack.append(i)\n\n\n        return ans\n",
